sequenceDiagram
    title Signed invite and cursor synchronization
    participant OwnerNode
    participant OwnerDB
    participant Relay
    participant MemberNode
    participant MemberDB

    OwnerNode->>Relay: Dial TCP relay
    MemberNode->>Relay: Dial TCP relay
    Relay-->>OwnerNode: Relay reservation
    Relay-->>MemberNode: Relay reservation
    MemberNode->>OwnerNode: Accept signed invite
    OwnerNode-->>MemberNode: Identify and contacts
    MemberNode->>MemberDB: Store group and key epoch
    MemberNode->>OwnerNode: Request sync cursor
    OwnerNode->>OwnerDB: Read messages and controls
    OwnerDB-->>OwnerNode: Ordered event page
    OwnerNode-->>MemberNode: Idempotent sync page
    MemberNode->>MemberDB: Verify, deduplicate, persist
    MemberNode->>OwnerNode: Publish encrypted message
    OwnerNode->>OwnerDB: Persist outbox event
    OwnerNode-->>MemberNode: GossipSub delivery

